Bugs found and fixed in LikeR.xs
.IP "1. A 1×k or k×1 table returned df = 0, p = 1 — no test at all. R collapses a single\-row/column matrix to a vector and runs goodness\-of\-fit (if (min(dim(x)) == 1L) x <\- as.vector(x)); now so does this. [[10,20,30]] went from X²=0, df=0, p=1 to X²=10, df=2, p=0.006738." 4
.IX Item "1. A 1×k or k×1 table returned df = 0, p = 1 — no test at all. R collapses a single-row/column matrix to a vector and runs goodness-of-fit (if (min(dim(x)) == 1L) x <- as.vector(x)); now so does this. [[10,20,30]] went from X²=0, df=0, p=1 to X²=10, df=2, p=0.006738."
.PD 0
.IP "2. Yates\*(Aq label was attached even when the correction was zero. R only says ""with Yates\*(Aq continuity correction"" when min(0.5, |O−E|) > 0. A table sitting exactly on its expectation, and every zero\-margin table, were mislabelled." 4
